    Ban dem KHONG phai logo ve lai: no sinh tu chinh tep goc bang mot
    buoc doi mau co quy tac (tools/logo_dem.py):

        · phan MUC navy  -> mau nga #E8E6F0 (dung mau chu ban dem)
        · giot VANG/CAM  -> giu nguyen tuyet doi
        · hinh dang, ty le, kim la ban trong chu "o" -> khong dong toi

    Day la "reversed lockup" - cach moi bo nhan dien co logo muc dam deu
    lam cho nen toi. Khong dung phien nen sang: mot mieng kem sau logo
    nhin nhu mieng dan, khong phai mot bo nhan dien.

    Logo co mat o goc tren ben trai cua MOI man hinh, cung vi tri, cung
